259	  - [x] Test `GetProductDetailAsync_NoRatings_ReturnsNullAverageAndZeroCount`: `SeedProductDetailData()` ohne `Rating`-Zeilen, `GetProductDetailAsync("PD1")` → `result!.AverageRating` ist `null`, `result.RatingCount == 0` (AC 3)
